{"is_source_file": true, "format": "sh", "description": "This script checks the status of system processes 'syseventd' and 'CcspCrSsp'. If either process is not running, it logs a message indicating that the respective process has crashed and sets a flag to reboot the device. If the reboot flag is set, the script initiates a device reboot. The script is used for diagnostic purposes related to system stability and process health monitoring.", "external_files": ["pidof", "dmcli", "psmcli", "sleep", "reboot"], "external_methods": ["pidof", "dmcli", "psmcli", "sleep", "reboot"], "published": [], "classes": [], "methods": [], "calls": ["pidof syseventd", "pidof CcspCrSsp", "dmcli simu setv Device.DeviceInfo.X_RDKCENTRAL-COM_LastRebootReason string Sysevent_Crashed", "psmcli nosubsys set dmsb.DeviceInfo.X_RDKCENTRAL-COM_LastRebootReason CR_Crashed", "sleep 5", "reboot"], "search-terms": ["LastRebootReason", "syseventd", "CcspCrSsp", "rebootDevice", "diagnostic script"], "state": 2, "file_id": 11977, "knowledge_revision": 38632, "git_revision": "7e30f88c4ca54db6e79d70eb5e919c86fb3e3bcf", "hash": "4c9296cb9df097eae4ed27c4b6ca49ea", "format-version": 4, "code-base-name": "kirkstone-7931", "filename": "rdkb/components/opensource/ccsp/CcspPandM/devices/scripts/TestAndDiagnostic/LastRebootReason.sh", "revision_history": [{"38632": "7e30f88c4ca54db6e79d70eb5e919c86fb3e3bcf"}]}